"Unzip and copy the .env and compose.yaml files to the folder of your "
"choice"

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:119
#: 2e32655402e14ab4b37db95868f5d5b2
msgid "Instanciez votre GoFAST Community"
