"Once the command \"podman logs -f gofast-ng-drupal\" returns the hand, it"
" means that the installation is complete."

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:137
#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:241
#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:371
#: 2542724839b74b55bac2f7e975dfad00 55ecd5c5f79c4e7a9682455a4e5a0ab7
#: e0174e1e1e504d669e627b81888cb131
msgid "Sur Windows avec Docker Desktop et Portainer"
msgstr "On Windows with Docker Desktop and Portainer"

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:138
#: 45656d87001c43f4acf8b31c5c97b0bc
msgid "Créer un dossier sur le PC et déziper gofast-community.zip à l'intérieur"
msgstr "Create a folder on the PC and unzip gofast-community.zip inside"

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:140
#: dccbc906e7404799aa1760c834355e15
msgid ""
"Installer l'application Docker Desktop : https://www.docker.com/products"
"/docker-desktop/"
msgstr ""
"Install the Docker Desktop app: https://www.docker.com/products/docker-"
"desktop/"

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:142
#: f971efbcec1748e5b01011faf5994895
msgid ""
"Lors de l'installation garder les paramètres par défaut, notamment "
"l'utilisation de WSL 2. Un redémarrage de Windows sera nécessaire."
msgstr ""
"When installing keep the default settings, including the use of WSL 2. A "
"restart of Windows will be required."

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:144
#: f5fab30d55684b2583cb0ba676c96ec8
msgid ""
"Après le redémarrage de Windows à l'ouverture de Docker Desktop, si un "
"message \"Docker Desktop requires a newer WSL kernel version\" s'affiche,"
" suivez la procédure \"Mise à jour du Kernel WSL\" dans la rubrique "
"\"Problèmes connus\"."
msgstr ""
"After restarting Windows when opening Docker Desktop, if the message "
"\"Docker Desktop requires a newer WSL kernel version\" is displayed, "
"follow the \"Update the WSL Kernel\" procedure in the \"Known Issues\" "
"section."

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:146
#: 941d8193c2f246b1ad23079bb2e98c44
msgid ""
"Dans Docker Desktop cliquez sur \"Add Extensions\" dans le menu de gauche"
" et installez l'extension \"Portainer\". Cette extension vous permettra "
"d'initialiser GoFAST Community de manière simple."
msgstr ""
"In Docker Desktop click on \"Add Extensions\" in the left menu and "
"install the \"Portainer\" extension. This extension will allow you to "
"initialize GoFAST Community in a simple way."

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:148
#: 6569599580244942af1bf93e2a90704e
msgid ""
"Ouvrez l'extension \"Portainer\" dans le menu de gauche et cliquez sur "
"\"Get started\""
msgstr ""
"Open the extension \"Portainer\" in the left menu and click on \"Get "
"started\""

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:150
#: 710b151de038440c81eb55d3decd1ff1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dans Portainer sélectionner l'environnement \"local\" en cliquant ci-"
"dessus"
msgstr "In Portainer select the \"local\" environment by clicking above"

#: ../../docs-gofast-technical/gofast-community-install.rst:152
#: 6db17ac6beba4093937ae8affb3e5e84
msgid ""
"Dans Portainer cliquez sur le menu \"Stacks\" (Dans le petit menu "
"vertical entre le menu de gauche et la fenetre principale)"
